  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Reforma en poltica y administracin tributaria I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Revenue Policy and Administration Reform I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es apoyar los esfuerzos del gobierno de Surinam en su agenda de reforma fiscal. Las reformas se combinan iniciativas de polticas y acciones del gobierno en tres reas: (i) Administracin tributaria, (ii) Politica tributaria, y (iii) la gestin aduanera.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program is to strengthen the countrys fiscal position over the short and medium term, through an increase in tax revenue, foreign investment and economic competitiveness. The specific objectives of the program are to increase tax coverage as well as improve efficiency in tax and customs administration.</narrative>
  </description>
